_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"A local commit replacement can leave HEAD unchanged while the source recorder writes the replacement tree. Source metadata, identity collection, final JUnit source checks and the platform clean-checkout gate now explicitly disable replacement-object resolution. The source schemas, JUnit identities, skip policy and source_authenticity=NOT_EVALUATED remain unchanged.\n\nExact HEAD f3c01a23fa5baaeeeb28eb8e9397e72b5ef4d5a1; tree c155c935a801fa98b7c78219c9798ce1f1be8848; base88b45c328bfdc8131ff0c6d139fddd8b27a4050c. Six ROOT-allocated paths only: four scripts, tests/test_ci_source_replacements.py, docs/audits/agent7-git-provenance.json. Old PR77 branch pointer preserved.\n\nVerification: the same ten new isolated-clone cases against immutable old source gave4failed/6passed/0skipped; final committed source plus complete selected pure guard modules gave68passed/0skipped. Cases prove actual raw-versus-virtual blob/tree/commit lookup under default/custom replacement namespaces, canonical source metadata and continued refusal of real tracked edits. Fixtures clear inherited Git overrides and mutate refs only in independent clones. Fresh independent reviewer found no P0/P1/P2 and reran10/10 new cases. Raw Git objects and working-byte fingerprints across782tracked files match before/after final tests; no replacement refs in the primary worktree.\n\nThe old88b full CI3123-identity result remains a historical numeric result, not retroactive adversarial qualification. New-head CI is pending. No native/broker/network/database execution, trading, profile change, merge or Math113 source/activation change.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-06T20:19:16Z","updated_at":"2026-11-06T20:19:16Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"69907acf84ee5c4f1ab8f811061bc4167bf76228","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"YehorBabenko88:agent7/me